OL,3,ANor'easter storm brings coastal
OL,4,Aflooding as New York and New Jersey
OL,5,Adeclare emergency
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of millions of people across the
OL,8,Fnorth-eastern US are in the path of a
OL,9,Fpowerful storm that has already brought
OL,10,Fcoastal flooding, power cuts, travel
OL,11,Fchaos and cancelled stadium events.
OL,13,FPeaking on Saturday, the so-called
OL,14,Fnor'easter will "bring dangerous
OL,15,Fcoastal flooding and beach conditions,
OL,16,Fstrong winds and heavy rainfall" to
OL,17,Fareas including New York City and
OL,18,FBoston, the US National Weather Service
OL,19,F(NWS) said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
